%% Data architecture — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart LR
  Providers[Provider data / document versions] --> Stage[Validated staging]
  Stage --> Files[(Immutable Parquet / artifacts)]
  Files --> Manifest[Validated manifest publication]
  Manifest --> PG[(PostgreSQL operational truth)]
  PG --> Domain[Strategies / qualifications / regimes / candidates / risk / orders]
  PG --> Ledger[Canonical journals / lots / positions]
  Files --> Duck[Read-only DuckDB research]
  PG --> Export[Watermarked analytical exports]
  Export --> Files
  Duck --> Eval[Evaluation artifacts / references]
  Eval --> PG
  PG --> UI[Versioned API projections]
  Files --> Backup[Coordinated backup / retained references]
  PG --> Backup
